property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "One of the bones of the upper jaw situated between and in front of the maxillae. [Dorian_AF, Elsevier's_encyclopaedic_dictionary_of_medicine, Part_B:_Anatomy_(1988)_Amsterdam_etc.:_Elsevier][VHOG]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-09-17", external_class="VHOG:0000426", ontology="VHOG", source="http://bgee.unil.ch/"}
