[Term]
id: UBERON:0002523
name: tunica intima
def: "The innermost layer of a blood vessel which is a lining of endothelial cells facing the lumen[Kardong]." [ISBN:0073040584, NCIT:C33820, Wikipedia:Tunica_intima]
subset: human_subset
subset: mouse_subset
