property_value: UBPROP:0000003 "The inner ear develops embryonically in all vertebrates as an invagination of the ectodermal otic placode to form an otic vesicle.[well established][VHOG]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-09-17", external_class="VHOG:0001148", ontology="VHOG", source="ISBN:978-0030223693 Liem KF, Bemis WE, Walker WF, Grande L, Functional Anatomy of the Vertebrates: An Evolutionary Perspective (2001) p.413", source="http://bgee.unil.ch/"}
property_value: UBPROP:0000012 "MP defines as epithelial sac, but EHDAA defines as multi-tissue; See https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/1305" xsd:string {external_ontology="MP"}

