intersection_of: UBERON:0001560 ! neck of organ
intersection_of: part_of UBERON:0002228 ! rib
relationship: part_of UBERON:0010388 {source="PMID:15906248"} ! proximal segment of rib
property_value: foaf:depiction "http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/Gray122.png" xsd:anyURI

