property_value: RO:0002171 UBERON:0000009
property_value: RO:0002171 UBERON:0006676
property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "An outer layer of smooth muscle surrounding a hollow or tubular organ as the bladder, esophagus, large intestine, small intestine, stomach, ureter, uterus, and vagina that often consists of an inner layer of circular fibers serving to narrow the lumen of the organ and an outer layer of longitudinal fibers serving to shorten its length[BTO]." xsd:string {source="BTO:0004838"}
property_value: UBPROP:0000008 "typically smooth muscle, but there may be exceptions - in the upper esophagus, part of the externa is skeletal muscle, rather than smooth muscle." xsd:string

